--TEST--
a payload value is checked like any other expression, so an enum case inside `#[...]` answers the same line it answers in a body, `rule:attributes/payload-is-a-compile-time-constant`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Blog
{
    #[Core\Route(path: "/", method: Core\Http\Method::G<|>et)]
    #[Core\Access(allow: Core\Audience::Everyone)]
    public static function index(): string
    {
        return "hello";
    }
}
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
```nvs
Core\Http\Method::Get
```

Reads a resource; safe, so no CSRF check applies.
